        {"title": "最高级 the ...est", "explain": "三者以上比较用最高级，前面加 the：the tallest building。", "examples": [
          {"en": "It is the tallest building in the city.", "cn": "它是城里最高的楼。"}
        ]}
      ],
      "tips": ["用 5 句话向外地朋友介绍深圳，可从 location、weather、food、places、people 五方面展开。"]
